  "description": "A dockable WPF terminal emulator UserControl for .NET 8. Multi-tab shell sessions (cmd, PowerShell, bash), 39 built-in commands, macro recording/replay, HxScript scripting engine, command history, find-in-output, export to text/HTML. Integrates with WpfDocking for VS-style panel hosting.",
